UI AutoSetup prototype: licences and credits
============================================

This repository combines four tools by three authors. Each part is covered
by its own author's terms, as set out below. NOTICE lists the files in each
part and what was changed here.

  Part                                          Author             Terms
  --------------------------------------------  -----------------  ------------
  Checklist Autofill, AutoSetup, and the code   Oscar Coleman      MIT
  that joins the four tools                                        (section 1)
  Moonfill (Moonpull scans)                     Rodier Sangibala   Rodier's own
                                                                   (section 2)
  Internal Review (Optimus Internal Review)     Kaio Da Mota       Kaio's own
                                                                   (section 3)


