2. Moonfill (Moonpull scans)
----------------------------

Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Rodier Sangibala

Moonfill was created by Rodier Sangibala
(https://github.com/OptimusRodier/moonfill, branch dev). Rodier sets its
terms. The MIT licence in section 1 does not apply to Moonfill's code, only
to the changes made to Moonfill's files here, which NOTICE lists. Until
Rodier publishes a licence for Moonfill, ask Rodier before reusing or
publishing Moonfill's code outside this project.


3. Internal Review (Optimus Internal Review)
--------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 Kaio Da Mota

Optimus Internal Review (v0.2.23, from optimus-internal-review-checker,
branch feat/v0.2-internal-review) was created by Kaio Da Mota. It is adapted
here, in autofill/review/, to run inside this extension. Kaio sets its terms.
The MIT licence in section 1 covers only the adaptations that NOTICE lists,
not Kaio's code. Until Kaio publishes a licence for it, ask Kaio before
reusing or publishing its code outside this project.


4. Tools used only for development
----------------------------------

The tests in autofill/dev/ use jsdom (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2010 Elijah
Insua), installed with npm. jsdom isn't part of the extension and isn't
included in this repository.


